{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"常值层"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"taxon":[{"Plain":"百科. "},3],"title":[{"Plain":"常值层"},2],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>对于"},{"Local":{"url":"意象","text":"意象"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathcal X$, <strong>常值层函子</strong>是"},{"Local":{"url":"几何态射","text":"几何态射"}},{"Plain":"\n$$\r\n    \\pi\\colon \\mathcal X \\to\\mathsf{Ani} = \\operatorname{Sh}(*)\r\n$$\n的左伴随部分 (拉回部分)\n$$\r\n    \\pi^*\\colon \\mathsf{Ani} \\to\\mathcal X.\r\n$$</p>\n"}]}}